<title>NORWAY: Norske Skog 1996 profits fall.</title>
<headline>Norske Skog 1996 profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	     13,265     vs	12,548</p>
<p> Operating expenses	    10,129     vs	 9,216</p>
<p> Operating profit		 1,916     vs	 2,500</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		   1,732     vs	 2,336</p>
<p> After-tax profit		 1,317     vs	 1,699</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian forestry company is Norske Skogindustrier ASA. A Reuter poll of eight analysts forecast an operating result of 1.84 billion crowns and pre-tax profits of 1.6 billion crowns. Four analysts recommended to buy the share, two said hold and one said sell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
